{"id":"ec51b0bd93fa3fdf","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-ctl-basic-tc.md","title":"EX、EF、EG 的有限图刻画","display":"thm-ctl-basic-tc — EX、EF、EG 的有限图刻画","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-ctl-basic-tc","aliases":["29-thm-ctl-basic-tc"],"display":"thm-ctl-basic-tc — EX、EF、EG 的有限图刻画","depends_on":["[[29-df-kripke-structure]]","[[29-df-ctl-star-syntax]]","[[29-df-ctl-star-semantics]]","[[29-df-tc]]"],"source_locator":"Section14.3.1, pp.237–238, scans252–253, before Theorem14.29","source_basis":"用户 DjVu 文本层及扫描253原图；本地核对三项证明"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-ctl-basic-tc"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-ctl-basic-tc</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ctl-basic-tc — EX、EF、EG 的有限图刻画"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8cb839e87a64afa7\" href=\"?note=8cb839e87a64afa7\" title=\"29-df-kripke-structure\">29-df-kripke-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e74e9bfdebb2e9eb\" href=\"?note=e74e9bfdebb2e9eb\" title=\"29-df-ctl-star-syntax\">29-df-ctl-star-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"76daeadc9ac4f409\" href=\"?note=76daeadc9ac4f409\" title=\"29-df-ctl-star-semantics\">29-df-ctl-star-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e0bc79e14d83be0f\" href=\"?note=e0bc79e14d83be0f\" title=\"29-df-tc\">29-df-tc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Section14.3.1, pp.237–238, scans252–253, before Theorem14.29"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户 DjVu 文本层及扫描253原图；本地核对三项证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K=(S,R,(P_i)_{i&lt;k})\">\\(K=(S,R,(P_i)_{i&lt;k})\\)</span> 为非空有限 Kripke 结构，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in S\">\\(s\\in S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathsf S_k\">\\(a\\in\\mathsf S_k\\)</span>。路径、语法及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_s^K\">\\(V_s^K\\)</span> 见三个直接上游。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TC}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{TC}_S\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e0bc79e14d83be0f\" href=\"?note=e0bc79e14d83be0f\" title=\"29-df-tc\">29-df-tc</a> 的反身传递闭包。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_a^K,E_a^K\">\\(P_a^K,E_a^K\\)</span> 在下式定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 可以是复杂状态公式，求值集合不被假定为一阶可定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P_a^K\\coloneqq\\{u\\in S\\mid V_s^K(a,u)=1\\},\\qquad E_a^K\\coloneqq R\\cap(P_a^K\\times P_a^K).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P_a^K\\coloneqq\\{u\\in S\\mid V_s^K(a,u)=1\\},\\qquad E_a^K\\coloneqq R\\cap(P_a^K\\times P_a^K).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"V_s^K(\\mathsf{EX}a,s)=1\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists t\\in S\\;((s,t)\\in R\\land t\\in P_a^K).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[V_s^K(\\mathsf{EX}a,s)=1\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists t\\in S\\;((s,t)\\in R\\land t\\in P_a^K).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"V_s^K(\\mathsf{EF}a,s)=1\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists t\\in S\\;((s,t)\\in\\operatorname{TC}_S(R)\\land t\\in P_a^K).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[V_s^K(\\mathsf{EF}a,s)=1\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists t\\in S\\;((s,t)\\in\\operatorname{TC}_S(R)\\land t\\in P_a^K).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"V_s^K(\\mathsf{EG}a,s)=1\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ s\\in P_a^K\\land\\exists u,v\\in S\\;((s,u)\\in\\operatorname{TC}_S(E_a^K)\\land(u,v)\\in E_a^K\\land(v,u)\\in\\operatorname{TC}_S(E_a^K)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[V_s^K(\\mathsf{EG}a,s)=1\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ s\\in P_a^K\\land\\exists u,v\\in S\\;((s,u)\\in\\operatorname{TC}_S(E_a^K)\\land(u,v)\\in E_a^K\\land(v,u)\\in\\operatorname{TC}_S(E_a^K)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书印刷237–238页、扫描252–253先给 EX/EF/EG 示例，再证明完整 CTL 翻译。这里只核验三个关系级刻画，未冒称已实现全 CTL 的两变量翻译器。</p>\n<p>EX：一个合法后继之后可继续为无限路径，因为结构每点有后继。EF：有限可达前缀可延长为无限路径；反向取 eventually 的见证位置，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j=0\">\\(j=0\\)</span> 对应 TC 的对角线。EG：无限路径的全部状态在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_a^K\">\\(P_a^K\\)</span> 中；有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 使某状态重复，两次出现之间至少有一条边，产生右式的可达非空环。反向先走到环，再无限重复该环，所有状态仍满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span>。特地保留一条实际边 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(u,v)\">\\((u,v)\\)</span>，避免把反身 TC 的空路径误当非空环。有限性是 EG 的必要适用条件，不能无条件推广到无限无环链。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-kripke-structure","status":"resolved","id":"8cb839e87a64afa7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-kripke-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ctl-star-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"e74e9bfdebb2e9eb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ctl-star-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ctl-star-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"76daeadc9ac4f409","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ctl-star-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-tc","status":"resolved","id":"e0bc79e14d83be0f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-tc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-tc","status":"resolved","id":"e0bc79e14d83be0f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TC}_S$ 使用 [[29-df-tc]] 的反身传递闭包。$P_a^K,E_a^K$ 在下式定义；$a$ 可以是复杂状态公式，求值集合不被假定为一阶可定义。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K=(S,R,(P_i)_{i<k})","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in S","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\mathsf S_k","display":false},{"tex":"V_s^K","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TC}_S","display":false},{"tex":"P_a^K,E_a^K","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"P_a^K\\coloneqq\\{u\\in S\\mid V_s^K(a,u)=1\\},\\qquad E_a^K\\coloneqq R\\cap(P_a^K\\times P_a^K).","display":true},{"tex":"V_s^K(\\mathsf{EX}a,s)=1\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists t\\in S\\;((s,t)\\in R\\land t\\in P_a^K).","display":true},{"tex":"V_s^K(\\mathsf{EF}a,s)=1\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists t\\in S\\;((s,t)\\in\\operatorname{TC}_S(R)\\land t\\in P_a^K).","display":true},{"tex":"V_s^K(\\mathsf{EG}a,s)=1\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ s\\in P_a^K\\land\\exists u,v\\in S\\;((s,u)\\in\\operatorname{TC}_S(E_a^K)\\land(u,v)\\in E_a^K\\land(v,u)\\in\\operatorname{TC}_S(E_a^K)).","display":true},{"tex":"j=0","display":false},{"tex":"P_a^K","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"(u,v)","display":false}],"bytes":2205,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-138","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-kripke-structure]]、[[29-df-ctl-star-syntax]]、[[29-df-ctl-star-semantics]]、[[29-thm-ctl-basic-tc]] — 有限转移系统、CTL* 与基本可达性刻画"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-179","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-thm-ctl-basic-tc]]"}],"outgoing":["8cb839e87a64afa7","e74e9bfdebb2e9eb","76daeadc9ac4f409","e0bc79e14d83be0f"]}